sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as ODH Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+
    participant Module as mcp-lifecycle-module-operator<br/>8081/TCP Health
    participant OSApi as OpenShift APIServer CR
    participant Operand as mcp-lifecycle-operator<br/>(operand)

    Note over Platform,Operand: Flow 1: Operand Deployment

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Module: Watch event (CR created/updated)<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+

    Module->>K8sAPI: Read MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>Check managementState
    K8sAPI-->>Module: CR spec (Managed/Removed)

    alt managementState = Managed
        Module->>K8sAPI: Read APIServer TLS profile<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI->>OSApi: Fetch config.openshift.io/apiservers
        OSApi-->>K8sAPI: TLS profile (Custom/Old/Intermediate/Modern)
        K8sAPI-->>Module: TLS config (minVersion, ciphers, groups)

        Note over Module: Render manifests:<br/>namespace injection,<br/>image replacement,<br/>TLS env var injection

        Module->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply operand resources<br/>(Deployment, RBAC, CRD, ServiceMonitor, NetworkPolicy)
        K8sAPI-->>Module: Applied

        Module->>K8sAPI: Garbage collect stale resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Module: Cleaned

        Module->>K8sAPI: Check operand Deployment readiness
        K8sAPI-->>Module: Deployment status

        Module->>K8sAPI: Patch MCPLifecycleOperator status<br/>(Ready, Available, ProvisioningSucceeded)
        K8sAPI-->>Module: Status updated

    else managementState = Removed
        Module->>K8sAPI: Delete operand resources
        K8sAPI-->>Module: Deleted
        Module->>K8sAPI: Patch MCPLifecycleOperator status
    end

    Note over Platform,Operand: Flow 2: Platform Config Detection

    Module->>K8sAPI: Read platform ConfigMap<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Module: Platform config (distribution info)
    Module->>K8sAPI: Update MCPLifecycleOperator CR status<br/>(distribution info)
